#: ../../content/facturation/checklist-fin-de-mois.md:122
msgid "the resident invoices are created"
msgstr "les factures habitant sont créées"

#: ../../content/facturation/checklist-fin-de-mois.md:122
msgid "7"
msgstr "7"

#: ../../content/facturation/checklist-fin-de-mois.md:122
msgid "**Insurer's share**"
msgstr "**Part de l'assureur**"

#: ../../content/facturation/checklist-fin-de-mois.md:122
msgid "the submissions are sent"
msgstr "les envois sont partis"

#: ../../content/facturation/checklist-fin-de-mois.md:122
msgid "8"
msgstr "8"

#: ../../content/facturation/checklist-fin-de-mois.md:122
msgid "**Follow up**"
msgstr "**Suivre**"

#: ../../content/facturation/checklist-fin-de-mois.md:122
msgid "every submission is settled and reconciled"
msgstr "chaque envoi est décompté et pointé"

#: ../../content/facturation/checklist-fin-de-mois.md:160
msgid "The deadline not to miss"
msgstr "L'échéance à ne pas manquer"

#: ../../content/facturation/checklist-fin-de-mois.md:162
msgid ""
"Health insurers usually set a deadline for receiving the month's billing. "
"Working backwards, the insurability check and the corrections should be done"
" in the **first week** — which leaves room to handle a rejection without "
"missing the deadline."
msgstr ""
"Les assureurs santé fixent généralement une échéance pour recevoir la "
"facturation du mois. À rebours, la vérification de l'assurabilité et les "
"corrections doivent être faites la **première semaine** — ce qui laisse de "
"la marge pour traiter un rejet sans manquer l'échéance."

#: ../../content/facturation/checklist-fin-de-mois.md:167
msgid "Further reading"
msgstr "Pour aller plus loin"

